# GitHub telemetry (Phase 4, optional).
# A fine-grained personal access token with **no scopes** (public data read)
# unlocks the contribution calendar and raises the REST rate limit from 60/h
# to 5000/h. Without it the build still succeeds: repo stats fall back to
# authored values labelled "curated", and the calendar renders an explicit
# "unavailable" note instead of zeros.
#
# Set it in the Netlify UI (Site settings → Environment variables) or here
# for local builds. Never commit a real token.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
